    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Coverage and operational gaps",
      "type": "text",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Verify after MariaDB restarts:** audit settings were applied at runtime; this dashboard cannot prove the audit plugin remains enabled or that every source event was captured. The DBCC heartbeat and event counter reflect collector-reported telemetry, not authenticated actor/outcome evidence. Auditd/Wazuh coverage is not established here. The host journal can contain raw SQL statement text; normalized DBCC records redact SQL literals. Prometheus retention depends on cluster configuration."
      }
    }
  ],
